    "reviews": "\u201cPocketCiv is shaping up to be the accessible 4X experience that I\u2019m desperate for. It\u2019s simple to learn, fun to play, and has plenty of variety.\u201d<br>Indie Game Reviewer<br><br>\u201cPocketCiv embodies a different approach to the 4X strategy genre. It\u2019s lighter, more playful...and if you\u2019re a newbie to the 4X scene, fear not, there\u2019s a comprehensive seven-chapter tutorial to ease you into the game\u2019s core mechanics.\u201d<br>Gaming Buzz<br>",
